// Integration test: real context, real beans wired together
@SpringBootTest
class OrderServiceIntegrationTest {
    @Autowired OrderService service;   // real bean
    @Autowired OrderRepository repo;   // real repository + DB

    @Test
    void persistsThroughAllLayers() {
        var saved = service.createOrder(new Order(null, "Laptop", 1000.0));
        assertThat(repo.findById(saved.id())).isPresent(); // proves wiring
    }
}
```
*The unit test proves your logic; the integration test proves the layers actually talk to each other.*

